{"3912320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "C.R.E.E.P", "steam_appid": 3912320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912320/extras/69c7f39944c075a00cc1aa818eef3b83.webp?t=1760227662\" width=616 height=55 /></span><strong>Play with up to 4 friends</strong> in this online co-op sci-fi horror experience where teamwork, tension, and tools are your only lifelines. You are a specialized repair crew, contracted to solve strange malfunctions and fulfill repair quotas across neglected space stations and crumbling planetary outposts. Navigate endless corridors filled with flickering lights, broken systems, and cryptic resident requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912320/extras/a89aa31eb9361f2e0bfb9d04b1334446.poster.avif?t=1760227662\" width=1530 height=578 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912320/extras/a89aa31eb9361f2e0bfb9d04b1334446.webm?t=1760227662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912320/extras/a89aa31eb9361f2e0bfb9d04b1334446.mp4?t=1760227662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912320/extras/e7007fd079b3ed4febf168062aff6221.webp?t=1760227662\" width=616 height=55 /></span>Every mission has a <strong>repair quota</strong>. Systems to restore. Equipment to stabilize. Residents to assist. Fail to meet your quota in time, and it’s not just your paycheck on the line—<strong>the game resets</strong>, wiping your progress and sending you back to square one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn’t just about staying alive. It’s about getting the job done.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your crew will need to divide tasks, fix faster, and think smarter. Use your clipboard to track your objectives, prioritize critical systems, and push yourself to meet deadlines while something lurks just outside the lights. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912320/extras/d840b8a16824050f0310efa76cab97b8.poster.avif?t=1760227662\" width=1234 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912320/extras/d840b8a16824050f0310efa76cab97b8.webm?t=1760227662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912320/extras/d840b8a16824050f0310efa76cab97b8.mp4?t=1760227662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912320/extras/bbe5b7ddfb7d8c91352bcb32167d99a7.webp?t=1760227662\" width=616 height=55 /></span>Your job is to fix everything. There is also lots of customization and upgrades. You also got your handy tools, don't forget everything out there is out to get you. Your clipboard is your objective..As you dive deeper into these isolated environments, you’ll uncover more than just faulty wiring—mysterious creatures stalk the dark, remnants of failed experiments and forgotten histories. Some residents are no longer human... and some never were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912320/extras/32907dafb5825358e2950677788aa069.poster.avif?t=176